# Review is required for these paths once branch protection is on ("Require
# review from Code Owners"). Until the repo has a remote and that setting, this
# file is a map of what is dangerous, not a gate.
#
# @quangpd is a placeholder derived from the current git identity. Replace it
# with real handles or @unicomhub/<team> before inviting anyone.

*                                   @quangpd

# Schema changes are the only irreversible ones. lint_test.go enforces the
# shape; nothing enforces that the change is a good idea.
/server/migrations/                 @quangpd

# Authentication, tokens, membership: a wrong call here is a data breach, not a
# bug report.
/server/internal/auth/              @quangpd
/server/internal/middleware/        @quangpd
/server/internal/handler/router.go  @quangpd

# The rules themselves, and the machinery that enforces them.
/CLAUDE.md                          @quangpd
/docs/conventions.md                @quangpd
/.githooks/                         @quangpd
/.github/                           @quangpd
/scripts/                           @quangpd

# One source for every shared version, and the token slots every screen reads.
/pnpm-workspace.yaml                @quangpd
/packages/ui/styles/tokens.css      @quangpd
